{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The YubiKit Swift SDK provides a modern async\/await version of the YubiKit framework, making it easy to integrate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in Swift and SwiftUI based applications. The async\/await syntax provides an easy to read and powerful way of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creating connections and sending commands to the different applications on the YubiKey.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection()","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()"]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This SDK does not perform zeroization of sensitive data in memory. Cryptographic keys, PIN tokens,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and other secrets are not securely erased when no longer in use. This is currently out of scope but may be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"addressed in a future release.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Warning","style":"warning"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Preparing-your-project","title":"Preparing your project","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted"]},{"anchor":"Sample-code","title":"Sample code","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/OATHSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/PIVToolSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthnInterceptorSampleCode"]},{"abstr